      <div class="ctitle cd">How §§316–324a connect across HGB Book 3</div>
      <div class="td-table">
        <div class="th cols-08-2"><span>Provision</span><span>Nature of the connection</span></div>
        <div class="tr cols-08-2"><span>§267, §264d</span><span>Supplies the size and capital-market-oriented thresholds triggering §316/§316a</span></div>
        <div class="tr alt cols-08-2"><span>§264(2), §297</span><span>The true-and-fair view standard §317(1)-(2) tests the Jahresabschluss/Konzernabschluss against</span></div>
        <div class="tr cols-08-2"><span>§294(3)</span><span>The parallel group-level information right §320 mirrors for the auditor's own needs</span></div>
